@page 55 morning-prayer
c __MORNING PRAYER.__
P O ye Priests of the Lord, bless ye the Lord:
  praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O ye Servants of the Lord, bless ye the Lord:
  praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O ye Spirits and Souls of the righteous,
  bless ye the Lord: praise him, and magnify
  him for ever.
P O ye Holy and Humble men of heart, bless
  ye the Lord: praise him, and magnify him for
  ever.
P O Ananias, Azarias, and Misael, bless ye the
  Lord: praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P Glory be to the Father, and to the Son: and
  to the Holy Ghost;
P As it was in the beginning, is now, and ever
  shall be: world without end. __Amen.__
R ¶ __Then shall be read in like manner the Second Lesson, taken out of__
